# Your Finance, Sales, and Inventory Systems Don't Match

Canonical source: https://webworldmaker.com/problem/erp-data-silos/
Scope: Machine-readable mirror of claims visible on the canonical human page.

When finance, sales, and inventory each run their own disconnected system, the same order can show different statuses in different places, and month-end reconciliation becomes a manual, error-prone exercise in comparing exports.